      "value": "@{64efcd179b2508914b4e905d|full_name}: Compute shaders in unity are just C# scripts, VRChat could make a component that lets you plug your compute shader onto your model. VRChat can then provide a list of keywords and properties that would be allowed for avatars and worlds. But we'll have to wait and see in regards to what will happen going forward with 2022",
